{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00923",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.14,
      "end_seconds": 16.34,
      "duration_seconds": 13.2,
      "text": "I can't sleep, and my head won't stop racing about work. I'm exhausted, and I came in because I didn't know where else to go at this hour."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.64,
      "end_seconds": 28.18,
      "duration_seconds": 8.54,
      "text": "I'm glad you did. Let's sort this out together. How long has the sleep been bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.19,
      "end_seconds": 37.64,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "About three weeks. I lie awake until four in the morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.52,
      "end_seconds": 44.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "What is the worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.51,
      "end_seconds": 58.79,
      "duration_seconds": 10.28,
      "text": "A big project at work, and I've been told there may be redundancies. I can't switch off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.78,
      "end_seconds": 66.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Have you had any thoughts of harming yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.24,
      "end_seconds": 75.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "No. Nothing like that. I just need sleep."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.15,
      "end_seconds": 85.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "Good, thank you for telling me. Any panic attacks or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.53,
      "end_seconds": 91.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "No panic attacks. No chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 95.16,
      "end_seconds": 105.63,
      "duration_seconds": 10.47,
      "text": "Doctor, I've done his observations. Pulse 88, blood pressure 134 over 86, temperature 36.6, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 16."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.22,
      "end_seconds": 119.14,
      "duration_seconds": 9.92,
      "text": "Thank you. Those are fine, a little up from stress. Do you drink alcohol or coffee?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.89,
      "end_seconds": 130.34,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "A glass or two of wine to wind down. And plenty of coffee, I'm afraid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.66,
      "end_seconds": 135.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "How much coffee?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.09,
      "end_seconds": 141.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Six cups a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.19,
      "end_seconds": 150.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "That will be affecting your sleep. Any medical problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.97,
      "end_seconds": 155.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Just mild asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.84,
      "end_seconds": 165.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.63,
      "text": "Have you tried anything to help you sleep? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.78,
      "end_seconds": 174.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Not really. Camomile tea, which did nothing. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.06,
      "end_seconds": 191.42,
      "duration_seconds": 14.36,
      "text": "Let me explain what I think is going on. You're under heavy stress, with caffeine and alcohol, and it's keeping your brain on alert. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.31,
      "end_seconds": 197.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "That makes sense. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.83,
      "end_seconds": 215.63,
      "duration_seconds": 13.8,
      "text": "I'd like to avoid sleeping tablets as a first step. Cut the coffee to two cups, none after noon, and swap the wine for a non-alcoholic wind-down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.66,
      "end_seconds": 223.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "That's going to be hard. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.03,
      "end_seconds": 241.09,
      "duration_seconds": 14.06,
      "text": "I know. I'd also like to give you a short course of a mild sleeping tablet, zopiclone, 3.75 mg, at night for five nights."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.7,
      "end_seconds": 247.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Is it addictive? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.64,
      "end_seconds": 263.01,
      "duration_seconds": 11.37,
      "text": "Not in five nights, but we keep it short on purpose. Don't drive the next morning if you feel drowsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.57,
      "end_seconds": 269.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "All right. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.54,
      "end_seconds": 285.34,
      "duration_seconds": 11.8,
      "text": "I'd also like you to book a review with your own GP this week, to talk about the work stress and plan the next steps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.7,
      "end_seconds": 291.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I will. Thank you. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 295.28,
      "end_seconds": 300.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "I'll print the information sheet for you. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.32,
      "end_seconds": 305.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Thank you both. ~"
    }
  ]
}
